    <var ID="V38" name="Q38" files="F1" dcml="0" intrvl="discrete">
      <location width="1"/>
      <labl>
        Really drunk
      </labl>
      <qstn>
        <preQTxt>
          <![CDATA[The next 6 questions ask about drinking alcohol. This includes drinking COUNTRY SPECIFIC EXAMPLES. Drinking alcohol does not include drinking a few sips of wine for religious purposes. A "drink" is a glass of wine, a bottle of beer, a small glass of liquor, or a mixed drink. 

Staggering when walking, not being able to speak right, and throwing up are some signs of being really drunk.]]>
        </preQTxt>
        <qstnLit>
          During your life, how many times did you drink so much alcohol that you were really drunk?
        </qstnLit>
      </qstn>
      <valrng>
        <range UNITS="REAL" min="1" max="4"/>
      </valrng>
